title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/kcp_rally.png
go-to: main_rally; sa_disrupt if sa_strength > 180 and not sa_banned and not return_to_normalcy

@sa_disrupt

The Anti-Democratic and Lampist forces have disrupted our rally!

- @police_protect: Call the police to protect our rally.
- @rb_protect: Use the Black Militia to protect our rally.
- @cancel: Cancel the rally.

@police_protect
view-if: kcp_in_goverment
on-arrival: police_protect_success = reichswehr_strength - sa_militancy*sa_strength;
go-to: police_protect_win if police_protect_success >= 0; police_protect_lose if police_protect_success < 0

@police_protect_win
on-arrival: workers_kcp -= 3
go-to: main_rally

The Police has supressed the forces that tried to crash our rally however we are seen using the police for supposeddly supressing free speech and lose some support.

@police_protect_lose
on-arrival: strife += 1; workers_hp += 3; workers_vnpf += 3

Unfortunately the police wasnt enough to hold back the mob.

@rb_protect
on-arrival: rb_success = rb_strength*rb_militancy - sa_strength*sa_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: rb_protect_win if rb_success >= 0; rb_protect_lose if rb_success < 0

@rb_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The Black Militia has successfully protected our rally against the mob! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@rb_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_hp += 5; rb_strength -= 50

Unfortunately, the Black Militia was not able to hold back the mob. They have won this show of strength.

@cancel
on-arrival: workers_hp += 3;

The mob won this show of strength.

@main_rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of our party what is the theme of this rally?

- @class_struggle: The empowering of workers!
- @democracy: Supporting and defending our republic.
- @wtb: Support the reconstruction plan
- @local: Supporting a unified Kadjan culture
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: workers_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 3*(1-dissent) if socialist_strength > neoforsvollrist_strength; workers_kcp += 4*(1-dissent) 

Our message of improving workers welfare without the need for xeroism is appealing to the commonly non-socialist workers.

@democracy
on-arrival: democratization += 1; pro_republic += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_kcp += 7*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; unemployed_kcp += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; pro_republic += 4*(1 - dissent) if democratization >= 3; new_middle_kcp += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3 

Our speakers defend our creation , the republic.

[? if democratization < 3 : The republic is newer than we would wish to acknowledge , its roots arent that deep and she does have flaws. ?]
[? if democratization >= 3 : Since we have consistently and fervently defended the republic the people receive this extremely well. ?]

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted = 1
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The reconstruction has been completed and the public does not wish to be reminded all the time about our efforts in it.
on-arrival: wtb_support += 1; workers_kcp += 10*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 8*(1-dissent); rural_kcp += 6*(1-dissent); new_middle_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_kcp += 5*(1-dissent);

The reconstruction has become a popular cry for our party!

@local
on-arrival: workers_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_kcp += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_kcp += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 1*(1-dissent);

The support of a unified Kadjan culture and identity though confrontational to regionalist cultures is generaly supported by the public. Less so by political elites or the most nationalists.
